flowchart TB
    accTitle: Seven-field representation of one documented mechanism
    accDescr: One central mechanism is examined through seven analytical questions: state substrate, control locus, transition trigger, persistence boundary, failure semantics, learning operator, and resource or governance policy. The fields are questions, not required runtime components.

    K[One documented mechanism]
    K --> S[S: State substrate]
    K --> C[C: Control locus]
    K --> T[T: Transition trigger]
    K --> P[P: Persistence boundary]
    K --> F[F: Failure semantics]
    K --> L[L: Learning operator]
    K --> R[R: Resource or governance policy]

    classDef root fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.6px;
    classDef field fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.1px;
    class K root;
    class S,C,T,P,F,L,R field;
